The '''Flex Helmet''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Helmet]]. It is {{Rift Transferable}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Flex Helmet''' can be bid on at {{zone|Barrier Street}}. The top {{Green|15}} bidders win the item.

== Usage ==
The '''Flex Helmet''' can be worn as a [[Helmet]]. Whilst in the [[Rift Dimension]], it costs {{Motes|100}} per second to wear. Outside the [[Rift]], it costs {{c|1k}} per second. The item displays the amount of time worn.

Attempting to use this helmet without the required {{Motes|100}} or {{c|1k}} will display a message saying: {{Dialogue|&c&lWEIRD FLEX!&c Unequipped Flex Helmet because you cannot afford it!}}After this, the '''Flex Helmet''' will be automatically sent to inventory, or to stash if it's full.

=== Interface ===
Right-clicking the '''Flex Helmet''' opens the following interface, which allows the player to select an animal skin.
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The '''Dog''' skin shares a texture with the {{Item|Mastiff Crown}}.
*Once modified, it cannot be sent back to the [[Rift Dimension]].{{Dialogue|&cThis item has been upgraded, enchanted, or modified! It cannot be transferred over to The Rift.}}

